{"seq":1,"slug":"factor-theory","title":"因子理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capm-apt","title":"CAPM 与套利定价理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory/capm-apt","wordCount":2620,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"fama-french-models","title":"Fama-French 多因子模型演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory/fama-french-models","wordCount":2348,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-zoo","title":"因子动物园与复制危机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-theory/factor-zoo","wordCount":2812,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"# 因子理论基础\n\n本章介绍因子模型的学术渊源与理论框架。从 Markowitz 均值方差理论出发，经由 CAPM 的单因子世界，到 Ross 套利定价理论（APT）的多因子扩展，再到 Fama-French 系列模型的实证突破，以及当前\"因子动物园\"引发的复制危机反思。三篇文档构成一条从经典到前沿的理论演进主线，为后续因子构建与组合管理提供坚实的定价逻辑基础。\n"}